Recover from a broken theme with a theme that is installed.

The recovery dialog that appears when a theme fails to load offered the
"antergos" theme for "Load Default Theme", and the same name was the
fallback when no theme is configured at all.  Only the small "simple"
theme is installed beside the system theme, so both now load "simple"
instead of a missing directory, which would leave a blank login screen.

